OL,3,ABlood tests find high level of
OL,4,Acancer-causing forever chemical in
OL,5,Aresidents near factory
OL,6,
OL,7,FBlood tests have found "really high
OL,8,Flevels" of a cancer-causing forever
OL,9,Fchemical in dozens of people living
OL,10,Fnear a major chemical factory in the
OL,11,FUK.
OL,13,FThe residents, from Thornton-Cleveleys,
OL,14,FLancashire, have been told they could
OL,15,Fbe at elevated risk of serious health
OL,16,Fconditions from the substance, known as
OL,17,FPFOA.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1790246874
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABlood tests find high level of
OL,4,Acancer-causing forever chemical in
OL,5,Aresidents near factory
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe village has been under
OL,8,Finvestigation for years by the
OL,9,FEnvironment Agency over contamination
OL,10,Fof soils and locally grown food from
OL,11,Fthe substance, which is a type of
OL,12,Fforever chemical - so-called because
OL,13,Fthey do not easily break down.
OL,15,FThat investigation said high levels
OL,16,Flikely came from the nearby AGC
OL,17,FChemicals factory, which used it to
OL,18,Fmanufacture coating for frying pans
OL,19,Funtil 2012.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
