OL,3,ATrump offers warm welcome as China's Xi
OL,4,Aarrives for US visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has greeted
OL,7,Fhis Chinese counterpart Xi Jinping with
OL,8,Fa military flyover and 100ft (30m) red
OL,9,Fcarpet to kick off their three-day
OL,10,Fsummit in Washington.
OL,12,FIn a rare move, Trump welcomed Xi's
OL,13,Fentourage at the airport as the US Air
OL,14,FForce band marched on the tarmac and US
OL,15,Fand Chinese flags flew.
OL,17,FTrump and First Lady Melania Trump
OL,18,Fwelcomed Xi and his wife Peng Liyuan at
OL,19,FJoint Base Andrews on Wednesday evening
OL,20,Fin Maryland.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
