OL,3,AIran's president tells Trump it will
OL,4,Anever 'bend the knee'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Masoud Pezeshkian has said
OL,7,FIran will never "bend the knee" after
OL,8,Falmost seven months of war with the US
OL,9,Fand Israel, but is ready for a
OL,10,Fdiplomatic solution to the conflict.
OL,12,FResponding to US President Donald
OL,13,FTrump's threat to "annihilate" the
OL,14,FIslamic Republic if a deal is not
OL,15,Freached soon, he told the UN General
OL,16,FAssembly: "The resistance of the
OL,17,FIranian people will only increase in
OL,18,Fthe face of sanctions, increased
OL,19,Fpressure, increased bullying."
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
